<<UpdateStat "+" "MomRelation" 3>>
<<UpdateStat "-" "MomLust" 20>>
<<UpdateStat "+" "Corruption" 3>>
<<Feel $mom "player" 3>>
<<ProfileLog $mom "The Crawl" "On the Friday after the silent week she stayed late at the office and apologized. I didn't look up. She changed into the green dress from her cousin's wedding and crawled across the office to my desk, and used her mouth this time. I told her what I thought of her while she did it. From now on she brings my coffee in the morning, and that with it. She said yes, and she sounded relieved.">>
<<ProfileMemory $mom "The green dress" "She was almost sure it still fit. It does. She left her heels in the office bathroom and came to me barefoot, on her knees, with her eyes on me the whole way across the room.">>
